"That's better than nothing!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SL8","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr SL8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You are absolutely right. Wow, Commander, you're a mess."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Oh, don't talk, save your strength!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Doll who broke through is heavily damaged, but she still rushes to my side. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After replenishing their ammunition, Squad 404 is once again capable of fighting back."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO hailing 404, we're approaching from your flank. Check your fire.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_pistol_finalshot_n","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're late."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The AR Team's firepower rips through the Military squad's flank. Between the two grenades going off amidst the soldiers and the Dolls' accurate shooting, the enemy squad is swiftly eliminated."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, are you alright?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not dead yet. There's one minute until detonation, let's hurry and get out of here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No problem. We're going to stage a breakout. 404, please stick close to us."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Naturally."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SL8","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr SL8","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, don't over-exert yourself, Commander. Come, it'll be faster if I carry you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SL8","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait, I'm not... Never mind. Then if you'd please."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"19winter_ sea","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks to the AR Team's superior firepower, the Griffin team breaks through the Military's final blockade. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Not long after we exited the base from the side, a chain of explosions goes off, and titanic quantities of seawater gush into the base through the breaches. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Dolls carry me to the upper levels and spare me from being swept away by the seawater."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, the soldiers still in the base are obviously not as fortunate."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I didn't think we'd actually wipe out the Military in the end... even if it was in such a way. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's just inconceivable..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But Ange and DEFY are still down there, and we can't contact M4. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If the seawater keeps pouring in, the under-levels of the base will be flooded."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sure they'll be able to escape."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I hope so, because we can't do anything for them from here. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Who are these kids?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Squad 404 brought them back here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Are they juvenile Nytos?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Are they the objective of Ange's investigation?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, I see you're still alive, K."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Were you expecting otherwise?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You came at a perfect time. These are the children that Ange asked Squad 404 to bring out. You must know something about them."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So they're the ones she found within the base?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"K studies the little Nyto hiding behind UMP45 with a complicated look on his face."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is there something you can tell us, Herr Schwaben of the Stasi?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"These children are not our main objective. Actually, we weren't even aware of their existence."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, when I was conducting my investigation on Paradeus in Southern Europe, I came across information related to the prototypes of juvenile Nytos. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It was a case report concerning an illegal orphanage."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An orphanage?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes, an orphanage in the south of Germany. We believe that was where Paradeus began their experiments. These children are clones created by Paradeus."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"For what purpose?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Paradeus was trying to create a human that could access the digital network in order to enter the OGAS System."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, that was just our conjecture. Nobody knows exactly how far along Paradeus is in their research."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A neural cloud computing space constructed from a human consciousness?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That's...not possible, is it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Unfortunately, it's true. I saw it in the lab."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Really...? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is just too strange. What on earth is Paradeus trying to make?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Alarm","raw":"SE2"},{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom! Boom!! Boom!!! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The ground starts shaking again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Brain","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Kalina","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are they still fighting down there?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Kalin","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It means someone is still alive, at least."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"19winter_aurora","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A brilliant blue light flares up from the submarine base in the distance, stretching all the way to the utmost limits of the sky, brighter than ever before."}]}]}]}
